        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-11T22:11:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, that makes me a little sad. I was really looking forward to pretending they had put this all together as some kind of weird birthday present, since my birthday is April 21st. (After all, anything I enjoy that happens within a week of my birthday was&nbsp;<em>clearly</em> put together as a birthday present for me, right???)</p><p>On the other hand, this means I don't need to consider tweaking the PTO I have scheduled for <em>this </em>month so I can actually watch the first episode live.&nbsp;<span>And better yet, now I can schedule to actually take <em>that </em>day off!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:02.246Z",
